<p class="tp3">Conteyning the Old Testament,</p><p class="tp2b">AND THE NEW:</p>
<p class="tp3">Newly Translated out of the Originall tongues: &amp; with the former Translations diligently compared and reuised, by his Maiesties speciall Comandement.</p>
